      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We haven't been this busy for a long time.",
      "translation" : "我們已經很久沒有這麼忙過了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't like that we're working with the President and the company, but it still feels good to be busy with something.",
      "translation" : "我不喜歡和總統以及公司合作，不過能忙起來感覺還不錯。"
