      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "... I was going to call her, but she's already here.",
      "translation" : "...我正準備聯絡她，沒想到她已經到了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
